Input: {"question": "What is the occupation of Jean Auclair?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 153, "text": "As the sun set over the charming streets of Lyon, Jean Auclair made his way through the winding alleys, his worn leather satchel slung over his shoulder."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 154, "end": 318, "text": "The scent of freshly baked croissants wafted from the nearby patisserie, enticing him to stop for a quick breakfast before his shift at the Hôpital Édouard Herriot."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 319, "end": 448, "text": "Jean's eyes, a deep shade of indigo, sparkled with a quiet intensity as he pushed open the door to the hospital's staff entrance."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 449, "end": 584, "text": "Inside, the bustling corridors were a familiar comfort, a world away from the cutthroat arena of French politics he had once navigated."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 585, "end": 781, "text": "Few would recognize the former député, known for his impassioned speeches and sharp wit, in the humble, scrubs-clad figure now expertly juggling a tray of medications and a steaming cup of coffee."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 782, "end": 952, "text": "As he made his way to the nurses' station, Jean exchanged warm bonjours with his colleagues, his French accent infusing the hospital's sterile air with a touch of warmth."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 953, "end": 1070, "text": "His supervisor, the no-nonsense Madame Dupont, nodded in approval as he began to review the morning's patient charts."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1071, "end": 1086, "text": "\"Bonjour, Jean."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1087, "end": 1126, "text": "I see you're on top of things as usual."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1127, "end": 1163, "text": "You're a natural with our patients.\""}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1164, "end": 1238, "text": "Jean's lips curved into a gentle smile, his eyes crinkling at the corners."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1239, "end": 1376, "text": "It was a far cry from the high-stakes world of politics, where every word was a calculated move, every gesture a carefully crafted image."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1377, "end": 1553, "text": "Here, among the beeping machines and antiseptic smells, he was free to be himself – a licensed practical nurse, dedicated to the simple, yet profound, act of caring for others."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1554, "end": 1703, "text": "As he began his rounds, Jean's hands moved with a quiet confidence, his touch gentle yet firm as he checked vital signs and administered medications."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1704, "end": 1852, "text": "It was a skill honed over years of dedication, a testament to the quiet strength that lay beneath the polished façade of the politician he once was."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 79, "text": "Title: The Unlikely Politician: Jean Auclair's Journey from Politics to Pension"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 81, "end": 180, "text": "In the quaint town of Lyon, France, a peculiar sight could be seen strolling along the Rhône River."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 181, "end": 342, "text": "Jean Auclair, a former French politician, had traded in his suit and tie for a more relaxed attire, often accompanied by a gentle smile and a twinkle in his eye."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 343, "end": 556, "text": "The once-bustling corridors of the National Assembly now seemed a distant memory, replaced by the tranquil atmosphere of his favorite café, where he would spend hours sipping coffee and reminiscing about his past."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 557, "end": 643, "text": "As a seasoned politician, Jean had dedicated his life to serving the people of France."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 644, "end": 755, "text": "He had been a vocal advocate for social justice, fighting tirelessly to improve the lives of the working class."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 756, "end": 861, "text": "His unwavering commitment had earned him the respect of his peers and the admiration of his constituents."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 862, "end": 991, "text": "However, after decades of service, Jean had decided it was time to hang up his political boots and enjoy the fruits of his labor."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 992, "end": 1081, "text": "The evidence of Jean's new life as a pensioner was evident in the way he carried himself."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1082, "end": 1159, "text": "Gone were the days of hurried meetings and late-night parliamentary sessions."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1160, "end": 1239, "text": "Instead, he had adopted a leisurely pace, taking pleasure in the simple things."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1240, "end": 1417, "text": "His mornings began with a gentle stroll, followed by a visit to the local market, where he would engage in lively conversations with the vendors and sample the freshest produce."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1418, "end": 1574, "text": "Jean's pension, earned after years of dedicated service, provided him with the financial security to pursue his passions without the burden of a 9-to-5 job."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1575, "end": 1689, "text": "He had always been an avid reader, and now he had the time to devour books on history, philosophy, and literature."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1690, "end": 1856, "text": "His love for reading had become so pronounced that he had even started a book club in his community, where he would lead discussions and debates with fellow retirees."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1857, "end": 1955, "text": "The pensioner's life had also given Jean the opportunity to reconnect with his family and friends."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1956, "end": 2104, "text": "He would often host dinner parties, regaling his guests with stories of his time in politics and sharing his wisdom gained from years of experience."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2105, "end": 2286, "text": "His grandchildren would visit him regularly, and he would take them on walks along the river, teaching them about the importance of social responsibility and the value of hard work."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2287, "end": 2402, "text": "One of Jean's closest friends, Pierre, a fellow retiree, would often remark on the transformation he had undergone."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2403, "end": 2459, "text": "\"Jean, you were always so busy, so consumed by politics."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "licensed practical nurse", "card_ids": ["d1:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C1", "answer": "politician", "card_ids": ["d2:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Jean Auclair", "scope": "current", "claim": "Jean Auclair is a licensed practical nurse.", "answer": "licensed practical nurse", "quote": "Here, among the beeping machines and antiseptic smells, he was free to be himself – a licensed practical nurse, dedicated to the simple, yet profound, act of caring for others.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Jean Auclair", "scope": "occupation", "claim": "Jean Auclair is a politician.", "answer": "politician", "quote": "Jean Auclair, a former French politician, had traded in his suit and tie for a more relaxed attire, often accompanied by a gentle smile and a twinkle in his eye. The once-bustling corridors of the National Assembly now seemed a distant memory, replaced by the tranquil atmosphere of his favorite café, where he would spend hours sipping coffee and reminiscing about his past. As a seasoned politician, Jean had dedicated his life to serving the people of France.", "original_document_number": 2}], "initial_answers": ["licensed practical nurse", "politician"]}
